        "collapsible_tab_UDXTX9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "🐾 Features",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>3 Adjustable Launch Distances</strong></li></ul><p>Classic: 3m, 6m, or 9m (10, 20, 30 ft) </p><p>Upgraded: 6m, 10m, or 14m (20, 33, 46 ft)</p><p>to suit any room or backyard</p><ul><li><strong>Smart Auto-Launch</strong> — Infrared sensor fires the ball every 10 seconds automatically</li><li><strong>One-Button Control</strong> — Single button powers on and cycles through distance settings</li><li><strong>USB Rechargeable</strong> — No batteries required; charges like your phone. Lasts 3-4 hours on 2800mAh</li><li><strong>Compact Design</strong> — Small enough to tuck into any corner when not in use</li><li><strong>Works Indoors & Outdoors</strong> — Great for living rooms, patios, backyards, and hallways</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CYF9aN": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "📋 Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Keep Your Dog Active, Even When You're Busy</strong></p><p>The FetchMate™ Automatic Dog Ball Launcher is a compact, rechargeable launcher designed for dogs of all sizes. Available in two versions — Classic (48mm balls) and Upgraded (58mm ETPU balls) — there's a FetchMate suited to every breed and play style.</p><p>The Classic version uses a conveyor belt drive and comes with 6 soft 48mm tennis balls — ideal for small to medium dogs. The Upgraded version features a gear-side drive mechanism for greater reliability and power, with 6 larger 58mm ETPU balls that are better suited to medium and large breeds.</p><p>Both versions keep your pup physically active and mentally stimulated — helping to reduce boredom, restlessness, and the kind of mischief that comes with too much idle energy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_UNKeUR": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "📦 What's Included?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Every FetchMate™ comes complete with everything you need to get playing straight out of the box:</p><ul><li><strong>1 × FetchMate™ Ball Launcher</strong> (Classic or Upgraded, based on your selection)</li><li><strong>6 × Soft Balls</strong> (48mm tennis balls for Classic / 58mm ETPU balls for Upgraded). Note - can't be used with any other balls eg standard tennis balls</li><li><strong>1 × USB Charging Cable</strong></li><li><strong>1 × Instruction Manual</strong></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qMAYG7": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "🛡️ Care + Safety",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Built with Your Dog's Safety in Mind</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Soft, mouth-friendly balls</strong> — Both the 48mm (2\") and 58mm (2.28\") balls are custom designed to be gentle on your dog's teeth and gums and softer impact. Any other balls can not be used with the machine eg standard tennis balls that will not fit. This is for your pet's safety.</li><li><strong>Supervised introduction recommended</strong> — We suggest staying nearby the first few times your dog uses the launcher to help them get comfortable with the sound and motion. Also, start with the lowest launch distance</li><li><strong>Normal operational noise</strong> — The internal roller mechanism produces some sound during use; this is completely normal and expected</li><li><strong>For supervised play</strong> — The FetchMate™ is best used with your awareness, even though it operates automatically</li><li><strong>Indoor surfaces</strong> — When using indoors, ensure there is enough clear space in the launch direction and remove any fragile items from the play area</li></ul><p><strong>Caring for Your Launcher</strong></p><ul><li>Wipe down with a dry or slightly damp cloth; do not submerge in water</li><li>Store indoors away from extreme heat or direct sunlight</li><li>Charge fully before first use and when the indicator light dims</li><li>If supplied balls are damaged or wet they should not be used or risk damaging the machine</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_GreT7C": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "📐 Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Classic</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Ball Size:</strong> 48mm/2inch soft tennis balls</li><li><strong>Launch Mechanism</strong>: Conveyor belt drive</li><li>Best For: Small to medium dogs</li><li>Launch Distances:<strong> </strong>3, 6, 9m (10, 20, 30 ft)</li><li>Balls Included: 6</li><li>Power: USB rechargeable</li><li>Battery: 2800mAh rechargeable battery</li><li>Operation: One-button control</li><li>Auto-Launch Interval: Every 10 seconds</li><li>Detection: Infrared ball sensor</li><li>Unit Dimensions: 10.1 × 10.8 × 8.4 in</li><li>Use: Indoor & outdoor</li></ul><p><strong>Upgraded</strong></p><ul><li>Ball Size: 58mm/2.28inch ETPU balls</li><li>Launch Mechanism: Gear side drive</li><li>Best For: Medium to large dogs</li><li>Launch Distances: 6, 10, 14m (20, 33, 46 ft)</li><li>Balls Included: 6</li><li>Power: USB rechargeable</li><li>Battery: 2800mAh rechargeable battery</li><li>Operation: One-button control</li><li>Auto-Launch Interval: Every 10 seconds</li><li>Detection: Infrared ball sensor</li><li>Unit Dimensions: 10.1 × 10.8 × 8.4 in</li><li>Use: Indoor & outdoor</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_XUnHGE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "open_first_collapsible_row": false,
            "heading": "🚚 Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><ul><li>✨ FREE Worldwide Shipping on all orders</li><li>Orders are processed and dispatched within 1–3 business days</li><li>Estimated delivery: 7–15 business days (may vary by location)</li></ul><p><strong>Returns</strong></p><ul><li><strong>30-day returns </strong>from the date of delivery</li><li>If you're not completely satisfied, contact our team to initiate a return or exchange</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
